<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-PARIS ST GERMAIN 0 AEK ATHENS 0 RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PARIS ST GERMAIN 0 AEK ATHENS 0 RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris St Germain of France and AEK Athens of Greece drew 0-0 in their European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final first leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 21,952</p>
